      "fit": "direct"
    },
    {
      "slot": "M",
      "plays_role": "Alignment between Paul's persecution of the church and the content of the creed he was persecuting. His anger ('breathing out threatenings') is aligned with the blasphemy he perceived in the deity claims of the creed.",
